<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces seized 8kg of hydroponic cannabis at the Nepal border and stopped a 700kg methamphetamine shipment bound for Malaysia, reflecting intensified cross-border drug enforcement. Bomb explosions in southern Thailand injured police, prompting tighter border security and expanded intelligence activities. Cambodia is escalating the Thailand border dispute at ASEAN and other forums, receiving U.S. backing and detaining Cambodians crossing a suspected minefield. A drone was detected attacking a Russian cargo ship in the Baltic, extending security concerns beyond the region. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPSFhXMXJTWUNLTllrZE1QQnhXV3BIc2tyRWRJbjl4cVpmMmNMZ3pPN2F4SFd5S1hlZnQ1X0N4a0YxZHZpLWU1Vmp6ZWdkdGlJQmxsVldidEM4dURJN3RycHJlazBza1hRelp3blBWd0U4YUV4Q3pBc09pMzBXcTNhUnFXaC1ScmRHbzRha0NwNjBBN19iRmpGSmJvUVJueUJIMWFNbGMzU21Xdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thailand Business News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOU3hnY2NMVkNDcDdWVm9CYlNycmhnYXJaRndvSU5VRkMwdllYT2ZRYmJkNXJSSEVzYk9fOVZpa25MQTQwVzNhQzExd0hYY1lkWlh3Qlc3ZXFpSG9YVHBRanRqUy1BUmZ5RGhab3BuTWIwenJ0WUR4ajFWMXJTSkFmaWZYT0FkVUlPaGt0VkhUNzZQVDFZcnBvUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOWVZzdkl4eVcyZ0NQU0hMTnNjUmFPM3ZlUzV4bEJTZmttdnJCQl9RUTE0QXJNS2c0VGZSWS1yZlhwNUp4X3FvMVc5cG9PV1dXUk9ZN1FwQkt6aUFYa2RsSUgweUhBbGcwd2RNdkhPQkg0amtIN1I4SEtLdUFxMGEwN0k0emRxTUtwVEVUN2FMRjJqejdNYU5hQW9lcHU5eW5ZUmJTeXZXcnpRM2dWQnpOeExR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kiripost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95c